cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BPM Tri-metodológico: PLS-SEM + ANN + fsQCA"
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Lizano-Mora"
    given-names: "Henry"
    affiliation: "Instituto Tecnológico de Costa Rica / Universidad de Sevilla"
abstract: >-
  Fully open-source reproduction package for a tri-methodological study of a
  hierarchical Business Process Management model, integrating partial least
  squares structural equation modeling (PLS-SEM), artificial neural networks
  (ANN) and fuzzy-set qualitative comparative analysis (fsQCA). Independent
  implementations in Python and R reproduce every numerical result and figure
  of the associated article. Version 1.1.0 adds the robustness analysis
  (Monte Carlo parameter recovery for PLS-SEM, specificity test of the robust
  ANN protocol and the Oana & Schneider robustness protocol for fsQCA), the
  manuscript in Spanish and English, and all figures in both languages.
keywords:
  - business process management
  - PLS-SEM
  - artificial neural networks
  - fsQCA
  - reproducible research
  - process governance
  - robustness analysis
  - Monte Carlo simulation
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/henrylizano/bpm-plssem-ann-fsqca"
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-22"
